 the relationship between language, text and context", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.28826728826728826, "x1": 0.8252747252747252, "y1": 0.3006993006993007}, {"text": "Question 1 (15 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.33255633255633255, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.34498834498834496}, {"text": "Examine Texts 1, 2, 3 and 4 on pages 3-7 of the Stimulus Booklet carefully and then answer", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.36596736596736595, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.3791763791763792}, {"text": "the questions below.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.38306138306138304, "x1": 0.2835164835164835, "y1": 0.3954933954933955}, {"text": "Text 1 \u2014 Feature article extract", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.43278943278943277, "x1": 0.3978021978021978, "y1": 0.4428904428904429}, {"text": "(a) How is the pleasure of discovery revealed in the feature article? 2", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4662004662004662, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.4794094794094794}, {"text": "Text 2 \u2014 Fiction extract", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.515928515928516, "x1": 0.33076923076923076, "y1": 0.526029526029526}, {"text": "(b) Explain how contrast is used in the text to highlight the child\u2019s discoveries in 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5493395493395493, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.5625485625485626}, {"text": "the museum.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5664335664335665, "x1": 0.2681318681318681, "y1": 0.5757575757575758}, {"text": "Text 3 \u2014 Poem", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.6161616161616161, "x1": 0.25164835164835164, "y1": 0.6262626262626263}, {"text": "(c) Explore how imagery is used in the poem to convey the wonder of discovery. 4", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6495726495726496, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.6627816627816627}, {"text": "Text 4 \u2014 Fiction extract and Text 1, Text 2 and Text 3", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.6993006993006993, "x1": 0.5857142857142857, "y1": 0.710955710955711}, {"text": "(d) Compare the ways unique personal insights into discovery are revealed in 6", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.7327117327117327, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.745920745920746}, {"text": "Text 4 and ONE other text from Texts 1, 2 or 3.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.749028749028749, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.7606837606837606}], [{"text": "Section II", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08236208236208237, "x1": 0.2153846153846154, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "15 marks", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11732711732711733, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "Attempt Question 2", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.13364413364413363, "x1": 0.2879120879120879, "y1": 0.14685314685314685}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.15073815073815075, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.16083916083916083}, {"text": "Answer the question on pages 8-15 of the Paper | Writing Booklet. Extra writing booklets are", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.18337218337218336, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.19658119658119658}, {"text": "available.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.20124320124320125, "x1": 0.1912087912087912, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.5274725274725275, "y1": 0.24397824397824397}, {"text": "\u2122 express understanding of discovery in the context of your studies", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.6945054945054945, "y1": 0.2634032634032634}, {"text": "m= organise, develop and express ideas using language appropriate to audience, purpose", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.27117327117327117, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.2836052836052836}, {"text": "and context", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.28826728826728826, "x1": 0.25934065934065936, "y1": 0.2975912975912976}, {"text": "Question 2 (15 marks)", "x